"""
DLMUX (ytdlmux) — modern yt-dlp TUI downloader for Termux / Android,
plus macOS, Linux, and Windows.

Usage:
    dl <url> [<url> ...]        pick resolution, save to the gallery folder
    dl -a <url>                 audio only (MP3 320k)
    dl -y <url>                 skip picker, best quality
    dl -l <url>                 list available formats
    dl -f "137+140" <url>       explicit yt-dlp format selector
    dl -p <url>                 download whole playlist
    dl                          URL taken from the clipboard
    dl -U                       update yt-dlp and this script

On Android downloads land in /storage/emulated/0/DCIM/ytdlmux and are handed to
Android's media scanner, so finished files show up in the phone's Gallery app.
On desktop they land in a sensible per-OS video folder (see DOWNLOAD_DIRS).
"""

